er. Engage targets at will. Collateral damage is not a factor.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/373f7f32783086a67364ed7ffcb03883.poster.avif?t=1777599785\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/373f7f32783086a67364ed7ffcb03883.webm?t=1777599785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/373f7f32783086a67364ed7ffcb03883.mp4?t=1777599785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><strong>Your Arsenal:</strong> Autocannons, missiles, flamethrowers, lasers, nukes, knives, <strong>sharps sticks</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/9f1b3518aec4efce3177e79826546c90.poster.avif?t=1777599785\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/9f1b3518aec4efce3177e79826546c90.webm?t=1777599785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/9f1b3518aec4efce3177e79826546c90.mp4?t=1777599785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><strong>Explore:</strong> Discover new cities, new civilizations...and turn them into parking lots.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/f7959e920b31ed1678523462aa6d8a3a.poster.avif?t=1777599785\" width=600 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888290/extras/f7959e920b31ed1678523462aa6d8a3a.webm?t=1777599785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https